  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(0.1³ + 0.01³) ÷ (0.5³ + 0.05³)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ = a × a × a\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 0.1³ = 0.001\n\n⇒ 0.01³ = 0.000001\n\n⇒ Numerator = 0.001 + 0.000001 = 0.001001\n\n⇒ 0.5³ = 0.125\n\n⇒ 0.05³ = 0.000125\n\n⇒ Denominator = 0.125 + 0.000125 = 0.125125\n\n⇒ Required value = 0.001001 ÷ 0.125125\n\n⇒ Required value = 0.008 = 1/125\n\n**∴ The value is 1/125.**\n\n6",
